{"articleNo":"238988","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=238988&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 2020년 주민세(개인균등분) 부과 제외 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.07.06","hit":"5275","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">지방세법</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">』</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">75</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">조의 규정에 따라 개인균등분 주민세 납세의무자는 매년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">일 구미시에 주소를 둔 세대주이나 아래사항에 해당할 경우 과세대상에서 제외되오니 해당 학생들은 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">. </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">대상</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">: </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">학업으로 인한 일시적 주민등록상 세대주</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">기숙사에 주민등록을 둔 학생은 일괄 감면되므로 대상에서 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">기한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">: 2020. 7. 17(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">서류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">학생증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">재학증명서 등 학생임을 증명할 수 있는 서류</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" styl